---
// BackupShield — Managed M365 + Google Workspace Backup Service
// Product page for cc3po.com/products/backup-shield
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>BackupShield — Managed M365 & Google Workspace Backup | cc3po</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Daily automated backups for Microsoft 365 and Google Workspace. 30-day to 1-year retention, monthly restore drills, and consolidated reports. Starting at $97/mo." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://cc3po.com/products/backup-shield" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0f;
      --surface: #12121a;
      --border: #1e1e2e;
      --text: #e0e0e8;
      --text-muted: #8888a0;
      --accent: #00d4aa;
      --accent-dim: #009977;
      --danger: #ff4466;
      --warning: #ffaa33;
      --safe: #33dd88;
      --radius: 12px;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      padding: 80px 0 60px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0d1a1a 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
    }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(0,212,170,0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,170,0.2);
      color: var(--accent);
      padding: 4px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
    }
    .hero-cta {
      display: inline-flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #0a0a0f;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn-outline {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

    /* Stats bar */
    .stats-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 48px;
      padding: 32px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .stat { text-align: center; }
    .stat-value { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); }
    .stat-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    /* Sections */
    section { padding: 64px 0; }
    section h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    section .subtitle {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    /* How it works */
    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .step {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 28px;
    }
    .step-num {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(0,212,170,0.1);
      color: var(--accent);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .step h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .step p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    /* Features */
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .feature {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .feature-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .feature h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .feature p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    /* Platform cards */
    .platform-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .platform-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 28px;
    }
    .platform-card h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .platform-card ul { list-style: none; }
    .platform-card ul li {
      padding: 6px 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    .platform-card ul li::before { content: '✓ '; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }

    /* Pricing */
    .pricing-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }
    .plan {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
    }
    .plan.popular {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,212,170,0.08);
    }
    .plan.popular::before {
      content: 'Most Popular';
      position: absolute;
      top: -12px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #0a0a0f;
      padding: 3px 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .plan-name { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .plan-price { font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 8px 0; }
    .plan-price span { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .plan-desc { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .plan-features { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 24px; flex: 1; }
    .plan-features li {
      padding: 6px 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .plan-features li::before { content: '✓ '; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
    .plan .btn { text-align: center; }

    /* Alert examples */
    .alert-examples {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .alert-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .alert-icon {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .alert-icon.danger { background: rgba(255,68,102,0.15); color: var(--danger); }
    .alert-icon.warning { background: rgba(255,170,51,0.15); color: var(--warning); }
    .alert-icon.safe { background: rgba(51,221,136,0.15); color: var(--safe); }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 32px 0;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .stats-bar { gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .hero { padding: 48px 0 32px; }
      section { padding: 40px 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-badge">🛡️ Managed SaaS Backup</div>
      <h1>Your M365 and Google Workspace data <span>backed up, always</span></h1>
      <p>
        Daily automated backups via Microsoft Graph API and Google Admin API. 
        30-day to 1-year retention. Monthly restore drills. Consolidated reports.
        Never lose an email, file, or Teams message again.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-primary">See Plans</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-outline">How It Works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-bar">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-value">Daily</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Automated backups</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-value">30-365</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Day retention</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-value">Monthly</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Restore drills</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <section id="how-it-works">
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Set it up once. Sleep soundly forever.</p>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <h3>Connect Your Tenant</h3>
          <p>Grant BackupShield delegated admin access to your M365 or Google Workspace tenant. OAuth 2.0, no passwords stored.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <h3>Daily Automated Backups</h3>
          <p>We back up Exchange Online mailboxes, SharePoint sites, OneDrive files, Teams messages, Gmail, and Google Drive every day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <h3>Monthly Restore Drills</h3>
          <p>Every month we test a restore from backup to verify data integrity. You get a report of what was restored and how long it took.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <h3>Alerts &amp; Reports</h3>
          <p>Get instant Telegram alerts on backup failures. Receive a consolidated monthly PDF report with status, trends, and recommendations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="platforms">
      <h2>Platforms We Protect</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Full coverage for both major SaaS platforms.</p>
      <div class="platform-grid">
        <div class="platform-card">
          <h3>📧 Microsoft 365</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Exchange Online — mailboxes, calendars, contacts</li>
            <li>SharePoint Online — site collections, lists, libraries</li>
            <li>OneDrive for Business — user files and folders</li>
            <li>Microsoft Teams — channel messages, files, tabs</li>
            <li>Microsoft Entra ID — directory objects (beta)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="platform-card">
          <h3>☁️ Google Workspace</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Gmail — emails, attachments, labels</li>
            <li>Google Drive — files, folders, shared drives</li>
            <li>Google Calendar — events, reminders</li>
            <li>Google Contacts — contacts and groups</li>
            <li>Google Vault integration for compliance holds</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features">
      <h2>Features</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Enterprise-grade backup without the complexity.</p>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔄</div>
          <h3>Automated Daily Backups</h3>
          <p>Backups run automatically every day. No manual intervention. Hourly available on Pro plan.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
          <h3>Monthly Restore Drills</h3>
          <p>We test a random restore every month to verify data integrity. You get a timestamped report proving your backups work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">📡</div>
          <h3>Telegram Alerts</h3>
          <p>Daily one-liner with backup status. Instant alert on any failure. No noise, just what matters.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">📋</div>
          <h3>Consolidated Monthly Reports</h3>
          <p>PDF report with backup success rate, storage used, restore drill results, and recommendations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔐</div>
          <h3>Granular Restore</h3>
          <p>Restore individual emails, files, or entire mailboxes/sites. Point-in-time recovery from any backup snapshot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>No Agent Required</h3>
          <p>Cloud-to-cloud backup via API. No software to install, no servers to maintain, no open ports.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="alerts">
      <h2>Alert Examples</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">What you'll see in your Telegram every day.</p>
      <div class="alert-examples">
        <div class="alert-card">
          <div class="alert-icon safe">✓</div>
          <span>🛡️ BackupShield — All 24 users backed up. 0 failures. Next restore drill: Jul 15.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="alert-card">
          <div class="alert-icon warning">⚠</div>
          <span>⚠️ BackupShield Alert — M365 backup for acme.com failed (Graph API rate limit). Retrying in 30 min.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="alert-card">
          <div class="alert-icon danger">!</div>
          <span>🚨 BackupShield Alert — Google Workspace backup for acme.com failed 3x. Manual review needed.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="alert-card">
          <div class="alert-icon safe">🔄</div>
          <span>🔄 BackupShield — Restore drill complete. Restored 1 mailbox (2.3 GB) in 4m 12s. ✅ Data integrity verified.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing">
      <h2>Simple Pricing</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Per-tenant pricing. Cancel anytime.</p>
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="plan">
          <div class="plan-name">Starter</div>
          <div class="plan-price">$97 <span>/mo</span></div>
          <div class="plan-desc">For small teams and startups.</div>
          <ul class="plan-features">
            <li>1–5 users</li>
            <li>Daily automated backups</li>
            <li>7-day retention</li>
            <li>M365 or Google Workspace</li>
            <li>Telegram daily one-liner</li>
            <li>Email support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/PLACEHOLDER_STARTER" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe — $97/mo</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan popular">
          <div class="plan-name">Business</div>
          <div class="plan-price">$197 <span>/mo</span></div>
          <div class="plan-desc">For growing companies.</div>
          <ul class="plan-features">
            <li>6–25 users</li>
            <li>Daily automated backups</li>
            <li>30-day retention</li>
            <li>M365 + Google Workspace</li>
            <li>Telegram daily one-liner + alerts</li>
            <li>Monthly restore drills</li>
            <li>Monthly PDF report</li>
            <li>Priority email support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/PLACEHOLDER_BUSINESS" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe — $197/mo</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan">
          <div class="plan-name">Enterprise</div>
          <div class="plan-price">$397 <span>/mo</span></div>
          <div class="plan-desc">For organizations that can't lose data.</div>
          <ul class="plan-features">
            <li>25+ users</li>
            <li>Hourly automated backups</li>
            <li>1-year retention</li>
            <li>M365 + Google Workspace</li>
            <li>Telegram daily one-liner + alerts</li>
            <li>Monthly restore drills</li>
            <li>Monthly PDF report</li>
            <li>Granular point-in-time restore</li>
            <li>Dedicated support + SLA</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/PLACEHOLDER_ENTERPRISE" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe — $397/mo</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq">
      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Common questions about BackupShield.</p>
      <div style="max-width: 700px;">
        <div class="feature" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h3>How do you access my data?</h3>
          <p>We use OAuth 2.0 delegated admin access via Microsoft Graph API and Google Admin API. We never store your passwords. You can revoke access at any time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h3>Where is backup data stored?</h3>
          <p>Backups are stored in encrypted cloud storage (AES-256 at rest). Data stays within the same geographic region as your tenant. We support US, EU, and APAC regions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h3>What happens during a restore drill?</h3>
          <p>We select a random user's data (mailbox, OneDrive, or SharePoint site), restore it to a test environment, verify integrity, and generate a report. No production data is touched.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h3>Can I restore individual items?</h3>
          <p>Yes. You can restore a single email, file, or folder. Enterprise plans include self-service restore via a web portal. All plans support admin-initiated granular restore.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h3>What happens if a backup fails?</h3>
          <p>We retry automatically up to 3 times. If it still fails, you get an instant Telegram alert. Our team investigates and resolves within 4 hours (Business) or 1 hour (Enterprise).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h3>Do you support both M365 and Google Workspace in one tenant?</h3>
          <p>Yes. Business and Enterprise plans cover both platforms. Starter plan covers one platform — add the second for $50/mo.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>BackupShield by cc3po — Managed M365 &amp; Google Workspace Backup Service</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><a href="https://cc3po.com" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none;">cc3po.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
